                                "sense_id": "079c2140-580e-3c56-a005-658239741709",
                                "text": "»Männerflohmarkt« stand da, »für alles, was Männer mögen, also keine Dekoartikel und Stehrümchen.«",
                                "translation": "“Men's Flea Market”, it said, “for everything that men like, so no decorative articles and knick-knacks.”",
                                "english": "“Men's Flea Market”, it said, “for everything that men like, so no decorative articles and knick-knacks.”"
                            },
