                                "sense_id": "079c2140-580e-3c56-a005-658239741709",
                                "text": "Unnötige „Stehrümchen“ nähren nämlich Unentschlossenheit.",
                                "translation": "That's because unnecessary knick-knacks feed indecisiveness.",
                                "english": "That's because unnecessary knick-knacks feed indecisiveness."
